# The KPI Plus rebuild

- Recreate the current Next.js site in `web/`, not the old WordPress site still live at thekpiplus.com.
- Visual and asset source of truth: `the-kpi-plus-static-export/` plus Corporate Identity Manual v3.0 in the brand asset pack. Serve hashed photos from `web/public/media/` and official logos from `web/public/brand/`.
- Copy, routes, SEO, forms: Markdown pages and `seo-manifest.json` in `web/content/`.
- Preserve all 93 routes, language prefixes (`/en`, `/ru`, `/zh`; Thai is unprefixed), canonicals, and hreflang.
- Thai default locale. Do not invent missing translations. Hide chrome links that do not exist in the current language.
- Calculators compute locally. Do not fake a form backend.
- Brand tokens (CI v3.0): Lime `#E6E81F` → `#A3CE39`, Teal `#0B6660`, Deep Teal `#0B1F33`, Charcoal `#3B3B3B`, Light Lime `#F2F8E2`, Light Grey `#F4F4F4`, Line Grey `#E3E8EB`, body `#555555`.
- Typography: Montserrat for Latin display, labels, and buttons; Sarabun for Thai and all body copy. Text on Lime is Charcoal or Deep Teal, never white. Lime is never body text on white.
- Website header uses the horizontal full-colour logo, 36–48 px high. Favicon uses the symbol only.
- Check new pages against `web/content/seo-manifest.json`.
